# THE CAMERA SHEET, for the owner to rule on before any of the camera work starts
# (#120 the targeting lean, #121 the glide to third person at full zoom in, df's
# #42 the constrained interior, and the body facing the lock). Four asks, one
# camera, and all four are sequenced AFTER the graphics by his own instruction —
# so this is the BASELINE, not the work: what the camera does today, at rest, as
# the lock takes hold, once the lean has settled, and at the nearest the zoom
# will currently come.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/camera_sheet.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --folk=8
coast calm
wait 0.9
shot 01-at-rest

# The lock: `hold target` is the real key held down, as targeting.tour does it.
spawn runner
wait 0.8
shot 02-a-machine-in-front with mob:runner
hold target
await target 5
wait 0.25
shot 03-the-lean-begins with mob:runner
await target_lean 5
wait 1.1
shot 04-the-lean-settled with mob:runner
release target
wait 1.0

# As near as the zoom currently comes: 09_view.CLOSE is 9.0 world units of view
# height, and the ask is that reaching it glides to third person.
press zoom_in 2.5
wait 0.6
shot 05-the-nearest-the-zoom-comes with mob:runner
